  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 501.01 Scope. This chapter shall apply to all prize assignments whether original, modifications, or amendments. This chapter shall not apply to tickets purchased through the iLottery platform.\n\nSource. #7094, eff 9-15-99; ss by #8898, eff 9-15-07; ss by #10987, eff 12-3-15; ss by #14530, eff 3-4-26, EXPIRES: 3-4-36",
